    "detailed_description": "THE NEW VAMPIRE FANTASY ACTION RPG.<br />\r\nThe Vampires of The West Coast have conspired against Ashzel. They've taken his Power Dagger in an attempt to Sabotage his personal power. He must face the Vampires in Combat. A Fire has risen in Ashzel, to Rise, Gain, Reclaim and Master his power. Rise, Gain, and Master your power as Ashzel. <br />\r\n\u2022 A World Full of Excitement and Eeriness<br />\r\nA world where action, mystery and sophistication are seamlessly connected.  A variety of locations with beautiful three-dimensional designs. As you explore, the joy of discovering unknown and overwhelming threats that await you, lead to a high sense of accomplishment.<br />\r\n\u2022 Embody Ashzel the Vampire<br />\r\nDevelop your play style, such as harnessing power, outmaneuvering the traitors, use combat skills to become a vampire warrior, increase financial wealth by collecting gold, nourish yourself with bottles of blood, and avoid deadly liquid traps.<br />\r\n\u2022 An Epic Elegant Drama",
